  "description": "Dandelion, the quirky, time-limited prince. He occasionally sees \"a fragment of the future.\" Sometimes it's a crucial moment, sometimes a trivial one... but once he sees the future, it inevitably becomes reality. One day, at a party, he meets Kelewen, the high elf who will save the world—and that fragment unfolds before his eyes.\n\n *\"Tell him you won't leave, Leon.\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
